OL,4,CRussia targets Kyiv crossings days     
OL,5,Cafter Ukraine hits Crimean Bridge      
OL,6,GRussia targeted bridges in Kyiv and    
OL,7,Grailway stations overnight in a major  
OL,8,Gattack launched days after Ukraine     
OL,9,Gbadly damaged the strategically        
OL,10,Gimportant Crimean Bridge.              
OL,12,FBallistic missiles hit key crossings   
OL,13,Fin the capital during a nationwide     
OL,14,Fassault which Ukrainian President      
OL,15,FVolodymyr Zelensky said was "one of    
OL,16,Fthe most massive strikes" of the war   
OL,17,Fso far and left at least nine dead.    
